hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"345","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"346","Umm ad-Darda' said"
"347","Anas ibn Malik reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"348","'Abdulkarim Abu Umuyyah came to Abu Al'aliyah and on him were wool clothes. So Abu Al'aliyah said """"These are but the clothes of monks"
"349","'Abdullah"
"350","'Abdullah ibn 'Umar said"
"351","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"352","Abu Dharr said"
"353","Anas reported that a man asked the Prophet"
"354","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
